  "releaseNotes": "Unified Simulation and Dispatch into a single High-Performance Coordinator.\n      - Integrated Network Dispatching directly into SimulationManager to eliminate intermediate hops.\n      - Implemented a Zero-Hop pipeline: Network -> Channel -> Priority Heap -> Worker.\n      - Reduced context switching and internal latency by removing DispatchManager thread.\n      - Optimized O(1) route resolving and automated object recycling (Recycle + Cleanup).\n      - Enhanced burst absorption using Bounded Channels with non-blocking Back-pressure.",
